### API

One page per `@dxos/echo` namespace, at `/docs/echo/api/<namespace>/` [D-157]. Collection, View, Dataset, Registry, Json, Format, Key, Error, Migration and Tag appear only in the generated reference [D-182]. Every page uses the promise APIs [D-158].

```mdl
